Subject: [PATCH V2] rtlwifi: rtl8192ce: rtl8192se: rtl8192de: Update to rtl_92ce_92se_92de_linux_mac80211_0004.0816.2011 driver
Date: Sat,  7 Jul 2012 21:03:21 -0500
Message-Id: <1341713001-5077-1-git-send-email-Larry.Finger@lwfinger.net>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.10.4
Sender: linux-kernel-owner@vger.kernel.org
List-ID: <linux-kernel.vger.kernel.org>
X-Mailing-List: linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org

Realtek driver rtl_92ce_92se_92de_linux_mac80211_0004.0816.2011 introduced new
versions of the firmware for rtl8192se, and rtl8192de. It also adds new
firmware for new cuts of the RTL8192CE chips.

Signed-off-by: Larry Finger <Larry.Finger@lwfinger.net>
---

V2 - sent to Ben Hutchings
   - fixed the mode for new files
   - made clearer the source of the new files

Larry
---

 WHENCE                    |   10 +++++++---
 rtlwifi/rtl8192cfwU.bin   |  Bin 0 -> 14818 bytes
 rtlwifi/rtl8192cfwU_B.bin |  Bin 0 -> 14800 bytes
 rtlwifi/rtl8192defw.bin   |  Bin 20526 -> 22978 bytes
 rtlwifi/rtl8192sefw.bin   |  Bin 88856 -> 80208 bytes
 5 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 rtlwifi/rtl8192cfwU.bin
 create mode 100644 rtlwifi/rtl8192cfwU_B.bin

diff --git a/WHENCE b/WHENCE
index 7de8c73..7acb0d0 100644
--- a/WHENCE
+++ b/WHENCE
@@ -1589,6 +1589,8 @@ Licence: Redistributable. See LICENCE.rtlwifi_firmware.txt for details.
 Driver: rtl8192ce - Realtek 802.11n WLAN driver for RTL8192CE
 
 File: rtlwifi/rtl8192cfw.bin
+File: rtlwifi/rtl8192cfwU.bin	- Driver for newer A cut chip
+File: rtlwifi/rtl8192cfwU_B.bin - Driver for newer B cut chip
 
 Licence: Redistributable. See LICENCE.rtlwifi_firmware.txt for details.
 
@@ -1604,7 +1606,8 @@ Licence: Redistributable. See LICENCE.rtlwifi_firmware.txt for details.
 
 Driver: rtl8192se - Realtek 802.11n WLAN driver for RTL8192SE
 
-File: rtlwifi/rtl8192sefw.bin
+File: rtlwifi/rtl8192sefw.bin - updated with
+		 rtl_92ce_92se_92de_linux_mac80211_0004.0816.2011 driver version
 
 Licence: Redistributable. See LICENCE.rtlwifi_firmware.txt for details.
 
@@ -1612,8 +1615,9 @@ Licence: Redistributable. See LICENCE.rtlwifi_firmware.txt for details.
 
 Driver: rtl8192de - Realtek 802.11n WLAN driver for RTL8192DE
 
-File: rtlwifi/rtl8192defw.bin
-
+File: rtlwifi/rtl8192defw.bin- updated with
+		 rtl_92ce_92se_92de_linux_mac80211_0004.0816.2011 driver version
+ 
 Licence: Redistributable. See LICENCE.rtlwifi_firmware.txt for details.
 
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
diff --git a/rtlwifi/rtl8192cfwU.bin b/rtlwifi/rtl8192cfwU.bin
new file mode 100644
